meta {
  name: Update User Profile
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/update-profile
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Vishal Kumar",
    "email": "vishal1232@gmail.com",
    "phone": "+91 94440 12345",
    "bio": "Building SaaS and AI solutions for Indian startups from Chennai."
  }
}

docs {
  # Update User Profile
  Update the authenticated user profile information in the database.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token (Session authenticated)

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Request Body Fields
  - `name` (string) - Full legal or display name.
  - `email` (string) - Updated email address.
  - `phone` (string) - Contact mobile number.
  - `bio` (string) - Biography or background summary.

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Profile updated in database.
  - `401` - Unauthorized or missing token.
  - `500` - Database write error.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "user": {
      "id": "usr_founder_01",
      "name": "Vishal Kumar",
      "email": "vishal1232@gmail.com",
      "phone": "+91 94440 12345",
      "bio": "Building SaaS and AI solutions for Indian startups from Chennai."
    }
  }
  ```
}
